              "text": "समझ नहीं आया (samajh nahīṁ āyā) — \"I didn't understand\", literally \"understanding did not come\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "समझ is \"understanding\", from समझना. It comes, or it doesn't."
